{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1012220001:0":{"text":"얘들아, 이 약초를 먹으면 아픈 게 나을 거야.","source_cn":"小朋友，这些草药可以治疗你们的病痛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE3EE19A5E65E52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012220002:0":{"text":"처음 보는 사람인데 그 말을 어떻게 믿어요? 저희가 속을 줄 알아요?","source_cn":"没见过的面孔呢，你们的话能信吗？我们可不是好骗的小孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E49E509659CC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012220003:0":{"text":"우린 나쁜 사람이 아니야. 타란 마을 하임 할머니의 부탁을 받고 약초를 전해주러 왔어.","source_cn":"我们不是坏人，是塔兰村的茴姆婆婆嘱咐我们把草药送来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4232CACBF5748A60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012220004:0":{"text":"안 먹어, 안 먹어요! 선생님이 모르는 사람이 주는 건 먹지 말랬어요! 예쁜 누나라고 해도 안 돼요!","source_cn":"不吃不吃！老师说不能吃陌生人给的东西！就算你是漂亮姐姐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x241B7C1026A3784A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012220005:0":{"text":"마, 맞아요… 안 먹어요…","source_cn":"没、没错……我不吃……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F455830D9475B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012220006:0":{"text":"얘들아, 안심하렴. 저 누나는 선생님의 친구란다.","source_cn":"孩子们，放心吧，那位姐姐可是老师的好朋友哦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79DE3156DA6DA1B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冷静的花灵":{"text":"냉정한 플로라","source":"冷静的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:勇敢的花灵":{"text":"용감한 플로라","source":"勇敢的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:胆怯的花灵":{"text":"겁먹은 플로라","source":"胆怯的花灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:温柔的声音":{"text":"부드러운 소리","source":"温柔的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":5}}